---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Mission | GlobSol Power Pvt Ltd"
  description="Delivering Unparalleled Quality Services to Our Customers across civil construction, electrical contracting, and solar EPC."
>
  <section class="page-banner-section pt-130 pb-80" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e73be 0%, #0d4b82 100%);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12 text-center text-white">
          <span class="text-white-50 text-uppercase fw-bold tracking-wider">About Us</span>
          <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-white mt-2 mb-3">Our Mission</h1>
          <p class="lead max-w-xl mx-auto opacity-90" style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
            "Delivering Unparalleled Quality Services to Our Customers"
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container py-4">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <p class="fs-5 text-secondary mb-5 text-center">
            At GlobSol, our mission is simple yet profound: to provide the best quality services to our customers. This commitment is a guiding principle that permeates every facet of our engineering operations.
          </p>

          <h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-4">Core Components of Our Mission</h3>
          <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">Unwavering Commitment to Quality</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Quality is not just a goal but a non-negotiable standard that forms the bedrock of our civil, high-voltage electrical, and solar EPC operations.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">Customer-Centric Approach</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">We put our clients at the center of everything we do, tailoring solutions to understand and consistently exceed their expectations.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">Continuous Improvement</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">We embrace a culture of continuous improvement, adopting latest technologies and lean engineering practices.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-light h-100">
                <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-primary mb-2">Empowering Our Team</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0">We invest in our skilled engineers and technicians, fostering an internal environment of safety, innovation, and collaboration.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-4">Guiding Principles</h3>
          <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-primary fs-3"><i class="lni lni-shield"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Integrity and Transparency</h5>
                  <p class="text-secondary fs-6">Open communication, ethical practices, and honesty form the cornerstone of every client relationship.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-primary fs-3"><i class="lni lni-cog"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Adaptability and Innovation</h5>
                  <p class="text-secondary fs-6">Proactively adopting modern technologies and safety standards to stay ahead of industry demands.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-3 text-center text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3763eb 0%, #6f58e8 100%);">
            <p class="fs-5 mb-0 fw-medium">Join us on our mission at GlobSol, where delivering the best quality services is our pledge to every customer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
